    "",
    "## 12. Notice",
    "",
    "Novi Corpus is not a law firm and does not give legal advice. This Charter is a fixed template; the choices in Schedule A are the Company's own. Novi Corpus did not choose this template for the Company and does not recommend an entity type, a clause or a grant. The Company chose to adopt it. Adopting it is not a substitute for advice from a lawyer. Novi Corpus is not a party to this Charter or to the Company's operating agreement.",
    "",
    "## 13. Adoption",
    "",
    "The Company adopts this Charter, with the grants set out in Schedule A, when the Guardian Wallet signs the adoption message that Novi Corpus serves for the Company's order. That message names the order, this Charter's identifier and version, the hash of the manifest that commits to this text, the Guardian Wallet and the time of signing. The adoption takes effect for the Legal Body when the Legal Body is created with that manifest's hash. If no Legal Body is created for that order, the adoption has no effect.",
    "",
    "By signing, the Guardian confirms for the Company that the Company has authorised the Guardian to adopt this Charter on its behalf, to give the agent the authority set out in Schedule A, and to fill the other schedules under this Charter's rules.",
